{"ordinal":11508,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453952577546","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Tough_Death_028f6e3","source":"Tough: Закончится в доме у одинокого фрика.","target":"Tough: Se va sfârși în casa unui ciudat singuratic.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-293.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11509,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453952577545","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Tough_Death_08fe7a1","source":"Tough: И эта вся моя борьба за жизнь…","target":"Tough: Și toată lupta mea pentru viață…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-293.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11510,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453952577544","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Tough_Death_000c290","source":"Tough: Ты действительно спустишь курок?","target":"Tough: Chiar ai să apeși pe trăgaci?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-293.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11511,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453952577543","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Tough_Ears_DontShoot_0a0c563","source":"Tough: Каково им будет?","target":"Tough: Cum le va fi lor?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-293.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11512,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453952577542","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Tough_Ears_DontShoot_0f30496","source":"Tough: Вот мне интересно, когда всё кончится, как будут чувствовать себя те, кто позволял слишком много? М?","target":"Tough: Mă întreb, când se va sfârși totul, cum se vor simți cei care și-au permis prea multe? Hm?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-293.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11513,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453952577541","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Tough_Photo_DontShoot_0de57dd","source":"Tough: Ты считаешь, что кто-то может остаться гандоном даже после смерти?","target":"Tough: Crezi că cineva poate rămâne un nenorocit chiar și după moarte?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-293.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11514,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453952577540","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Tough_Photo_DontShoot_082165f","source":"Tough: Вот ты веришь в ауру? Душу? Ещё что-то такое?","target":"Tough: Tu crezi în aură? În suflet? În alte chestii de genul ăsta?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-293.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11515,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453952577539","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Tough_Armpit_DontShoot_00eb97c","source":"Tough: Насколько этот мир проклят…","target":"Tough: Cât de blestemată e lumea asta…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-293.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11516,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453952577538","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Tough_Armpit_DontShoot_0ee74ec","source":"Tough: И убив меня, ты бы смотрел тело?..","target":"Tough: Și după ce m-ai omorî, te-ai uita la cadavrul meu?..","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-293.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11517,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453952577537","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Tough_Armpit_DontShoot_09c6df9","source":"Tough: Оно действительно того стоит? Ты бы меня застрелил, если бы вдруг захотел?","target":"Tough: Chiar merită? M-ai împușca dacă pur și simplu ai avea chef?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-293.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11518,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453952577536","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Tough_Eyes_DontShoot_005197e","source":"Tough: Надо просто бороться за жизнь дальше.","target":"Tough: Trebuie doar să continuăm să luptăm pentru viață.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-293.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11519,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453948383244","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Tough_Eyes_DontShoot_00e53b9","source":"Tough: Но по-другому не будет.","target":"Tough: Dar altfel n-o să fie.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-293.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11520,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453948383243","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Tough_Eyes_DontShoot_00093e0","source":"Tough: Мне не нравится видеть всё, что происходит вокруг нас сейчас.","target":"Tough: Nu-mi place să văd tot ce se întâmplă în jurul nostru acum.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-293.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11521,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453948383242","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Tough_Hands_DontShoot_05f2fff","source":"Tough: Но самой так приятно просто… хорошо выглядеть. Нравиться самой себе.","target":"Tough: Dar mie îmi face plăcere să… arăt bine. Să-mi plac mie însămi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-293.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11522,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453948383241","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Tough_Hands_DontShoot_079214b","source":"Tough: Да, красота сейчас ничего не значит.","target":"Tough: Da, frumusețea nu mai înseamnă nimic acum.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-293.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
