{"ordinal":11524,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453948383239","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Tough_Teeth_DontShoot_0139817","source":"Tough: Это ты испытываешь меня? Ну как, прошла испытание? Не дрогнула?","target":"Tough: Mă pui la încercare? Ei, am trecut testul? N-am tresărit?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-293.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
